{
 "schema": "chopinfer.tap-declaration.v2",
 "model": "qwen38",
 "v1_schema": "chopinfer.qwen38.capture.v1",
 "about": [
  "The engine's taps (models/qwen38/bundle/src/dump.rs), in program order except that full attention's attn.core precedes linear attention's. The first entry whose name matches, in its layers when given, applies; {nn} is a two-digit layer.",
  "Names follow docs/reference-runner.md (\"Taps and tapdiff\") (tools/refrun/taps.py's grammar). v1 is the tap's name in chopinfer.qwen38.capture.v1 dumps, which tapdiff and the Qwen tools still read.",
  "cols is the full width; a col_shards rank holds cols / ranks of it, its share of every [heads, dim] block. Taps without cols or blocks have per-rank layouts tapdiff does not reduce.",
  "ranks \"every\": each rank computes the same value and each rank's copy is written. detail: written only in the layers CHOPINFER_TAPS_LAYERS names.",
  "The reference taps the canonical names on the HF Qwen3.8 modules: enc.vision.out is model.visual.merger's output, the merged rows; L<nn>.in.streams is X entering the layer (all streams); L<nn>.x.hc.attn and .x.hc.mlp the hyper-connection's mixed sublayer input before the sublayer's norm; L<nn>.attn.core the input of o_proj (full) or out_proj (linear); L<nn>.attn.out and .mlp.out the self_attn or linear_attn and mlp outputs; L<nn>.router.* mlp.gate's outputs 0 (logits), 2 (ids) and 1 (weights); L<nn>.out X after the layer; L01.x.ple.out X after the PLE residual add; final.x.hc.mixer the hyper_connection_mixer output."
 ],
 "taps": [
  {"name": "enc.vision.out", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 2560, "layout": "hidden; the vision tower's merged rows on the encoder row axis, written from rank 0's media arena", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "embed.out", "v1": "embed", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560)", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "L01.in.streams", "v1": "layer01.ple.in", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560)", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "L01.x.ple.out", "v1": "layer01.ple.out", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560)", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "L01.x.ple.ngram", "v1": "layer01.ple.ngram", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 2560, "layout": "hidden", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L01.x.ple.gated", "v1": "layer01.ple.gated", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560)", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L01.x.ple.conv", "v1": "layer01.ple.conv", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560)", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L01.x.hc.attn.streams", "v1": "layer01.in.x", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560); X after the PLE add entering the attention hyper-connection, L01.x.ple.out's value", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "L{nn}.in.streams", "v1": "layer{nn}.in.x", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560)", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.hc.attn.xn", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.hc.xn", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560)", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.hc.attn.inject", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.hc.inject", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 4, "layout": "streams", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.hc.attn", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.in", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 2560, "layout": "hidden", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.gdn.qkv", "v1": "layer{nn}.lin.qkv", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "q | k | v, heads x 128, head-major", "compare": "dense", "sharding": {"col_shards": {"axis": "heads", "blocks": [[16, 128], [16, 128], [48, 128]]}}, "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.gdn.z", "v1": "layer{nn}.lin.z", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 6144, "layout": "value heads x 128", "compare": "dense", "sharding": {"col_shards": {"axis": "heads", "blocks": [[48, 128]]}}, "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.gdn.ab", "v1": "layer{nn}.lin.ab", "dtype": "bf16", "layout": "per rank: its value heads' a then b, padded to a multiple of 8", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "col_shards", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.gdn.conv", "v1": "layer{nn}.lin.conv", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "q | k | v, heads x 128, head-major", "compare": "dense", "sharding": {"col_shards": {"axis": "heads", "blocks": [[16, 128], [16, 128], [48, 128]]}}, "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.gdn.core", "v1": "layer{nn}.lin.core", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 6144, "layout": "value heads x 128", "compare": "dense", "sharding": {"col_shards": {"axis": "heads", "blocks": [[48, 128]]}}, "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.attn.core", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.gated", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 6144, "layout": "query heads x 256", "compare": "dense", "sharding": {"col_shards": {"axis": "heads", "blocks": [[24, 256]]}}, "detail": true, "layers": [3, 7, 11, 15, 19, 23, 27, 31, 35, 39, 43, 47]},
  {"name": "L{nn}.attn.core", "v1": "layer{nn}.lin.normed", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 6144, "layout": "value heads x 128", "compare": "dense", "sharding": {"col_shards": {"axis": "heads", "blocks": [[48, 128]]}}, "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.attn.qkv", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.qkv", "dtype": "bf16", "layout": "per rank: its query heads' query then gate, its KV head's K, then V", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "col_shards", "detail": true, "layers": [3, 7, 11, 15, 19, 23, 27, 31, 35, 39, 43, 47]},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.indexer.qk", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.index", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 640, "layout": "index heads + 1 x 128", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated", "ranks": "every", "detail": true, "layers": [3, 7, 11, 15, 19, 23, 27, 31, 35, 39, 43, 47]},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.attn.q_rope", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.q", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 6144, "layout": "query heads x 256", "compare": "dense", "sharding": {"col_shards": {"axis": "heads", "blocks": [[24, 256]]}}, "detail": true, "layers": [3, 7, 11, 15, 19, 23, 27, 31, 35, 39, 43, 47]},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.indexer.topk", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.selected", "dtype": "u32", "cols": 512, "layout": "selected KV blocks", "compare": "set", "sharding": "replicated", "ranks": "every", "layers": [3, 7, 11, 15, 19, 23, 27, 31, 35, 39, 43, 47]},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.attn.ungated", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.core", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 6144, "layout": "query heads x 256, before the gate", "compare": "dense", "sharding": {"col_shards": {"axis": "heads", "blocks": [[24, 256]]}}, "detail": true, "layers": [3, 7, 11, 15, 19, 23, 27, 31, 35, 39, 43, 47]},
  {"name": "L{nn}.attn.out", "v1": "layer{nn}.attn.partial", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 2560, "layout": "hidden", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "rank_partial"},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.hc.mlp.xn", "v1": "layer{nn}.mlp.hc.xn", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560)", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.hc.mlp.inject", "v1": "layer{nn}.mlp.hc.inject", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 4, "layout": "streams", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.hc.mlp", "v1": "layer{nn}.mlp.in", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 2560, "layout": "hidden", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "L{nn}.router.logits", "v1": "layer{nn}.router.logits", "dtype": "f32", "cols": 512, "layout": "experts", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "L{nn}.router.ids", "v1": "layer{nn}.moe.ids", "dtype": "u32", "cols": 10, "layout": "top-k expert ids", "compare": "set", "sharding": "replicated", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.router.weights", "v1": "layer{nn}.moe.weights", "dtype": "f32", "cols": 10, "layout": "top-k weights, in the order of router.ids", "compare": "paired", "sharding": "replicated", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.moe.intermediate", "v1": "layer{nn}.moe.intermediate", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 6400, "layout": "top-k slots x 640; each rank fills the slots of its experts", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "expert_partial", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.moe.routed", "v1": "layer{nn}.moe.routed", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 25600, "layout": "top-k slots x hidden; each rank fills the slots of its experts", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "expert_partial", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.x.moe.shared_intermediate", "v1": "layer{nn}.mlp.shared_intermediate", "dtype": "bf16", "layout": "per rank: its shared expert columns, zero-padded to 128", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "col_shards", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.moe.shared", "v1": "layer{nn}.mlp.shared", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 2560, "layout": "hidden", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "rank_partial", "detail": true},
  {"name": "L{nn}.mlp.out", "v1": "layer{nn}.mlp.partial", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 2560, "layout": "hidden", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "rank_partial"},
  {"name": "L{nn}.out", "v1": "layer{nn}.out.x", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 10240, "layout": "streams x hidden (4 x 2560)", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"},
  {"name": "final.x.hc.mixer", "v1": "final.u", "dtype": "bf16", "cols": 2560, "layout": "hidden", "compare": "dense", "sharding": "replicated"}
